1
00:00:00,715 --> 00:00:01,755
(Raj(running in):)Hey, guess what.

2
00:00:01,925 --> 00:00:04,175
(Raj(running in):)I've been accepted as a test subject
for a drug...

3
00:00:04,344 --> 00:00:06,514
(Raj(running in):)...to overcome pathological shyness.

4
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:09,809
- Oh, good for you, Raj.
- Yes, I'm very hopeful.

5
00:00:09,974 --> 00:00:11,604
(Raj:)Hello, Missy.

6
00:00:21,277 --> 00:00:23,697
(Raj:)They mentioned
there may be side effects.

7
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,320
(Leonard:)So, Missy...

8
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:31,912
(Raj:)...have you ever met a man
from the exotic subcontinent of India?

9
00:00:32,497 --> 00:00:36,877
- Well, there's Dr. Patel at our church.
- Yes, Patel. Good man.

10
00:00:37,043 --> 00:00:40,133
Do you like motorcycles?
Because I ride a hog.

11
00:00:40,797 --> 00:00:44,177
A hog? You have a two-cylinder scooter
with a basket in the front.

12
00:00:45,969 --> 00:00:49,309
(Howard:)You still have to wear a helmet.

13
00:00:49,848 --> 00:00:52,808
- Have you ever heard of the Kama Sutra?
- The sex book.

14
00:00:52,976 --> 00:00:54,936
(Raj:)The Indian sex book.

15
00:00:55,103 --> 00:00:58,813
(Raj:)In other words, if you wonder, wonder
who wrote the book of love...

16
00:00:58,982 --> 00:01:02,022
(Raj:)...it was us.

